  <h2>Developing new products for the bakery</h2>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Developing new products for the bakery is not as straightforward as it may seem. Market research on potential returns, new product development and ultimately producing it at scale all require careful planning. Organizing all necessary changes within your production and finding the best possible working method within your company are challenges that Pinso Benelux can help you overcome successfully.</p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">Pinso BENELUX has extensive experience in developing products and concepts for the bakery. We have a great knowledge of French methods and products and their introduction into the Benelux market. Through our ongoing contacts within many bakeries worldwide, we always stay informed about new bakery products and emerging trends.</p>
  <p style="text-align:justify;">After a thorough analysis of your production and market situation, we will be happy to provide you with tailored advice or recipes. If necessary, we can also provide customized training for your staff and help introduce the new products to your customers.</p>
